# intermission.vmus: tally screens between levels, docs/design/audio.md Music.
# Original composition for this project. Mood: short loop, a breather.
# The title motif (D A G A C A) slowed onto the harp, D "Egyptian" pentatonic.
# Channels: 0 harp melody, 1 pad (arpeggiated), 2 bass, 3 light percussion.
# Tempo 4: 4 rows per beat = 131 BPM, a pattern is 4 bars = 7.31 s; the whole
# song (2 patterns, 14.6 s) loops from the start.
vmus 1
tempo 4

inst 01 pluck    vol=60 a=0 d=0 s=64 r=14 damp=255  # harp melody
inst 02 triangle vol=56 a=1 d=0 s=64 r=4            # soft bass
inst 03 triangle vol=56 a=0 d=5 s=0                 # soft kick: pitch drops with D7f
inst 04 noise    vol=28 a=0 d=2 s=0                 # tick
inst 05 noise    vol=30 a=0 d=3 s=0 mode=1          # small bell clank
inst 08 square   vol=24 a=6 d=16 s=30 r=12 duty=128 # pad (arpeggiated)

